// OpenFOAM ASCII polyMesh import regression.
//
// The mesh is a 2x1x1 box [0,2]x[0,1]x[0,1] split at x=1 into two hexes:
//   12 points, 11 faces (1 internal + 10 boundary), 2 cells.
// Closed-form anchors: total volume 2, each cell volume 1, every face area 1,
// total external area 10, bounding box (0,0,0)->(2,1,1).
// Boundary patch types exercise the conservative mapping:
//   patch -> wall, 67 -> wall, empty -> symmetry, wall -> wall.

mesh
{
    format    openfoam;
    directory polyMesh;
}
